            <h2>Route Overview: Los Angeles to San Diego</h2>
            <p>Traveling from Los Angeles to San Diego by train is one of the most convenient and scenic routes in California, connecting the state’s largest city with its second-largest coastal city. This route is primarily served by Amtrak’s Pacific Surf liner, which offers a mix of speed, comfort, and coastal views, making it a preferred choice for both leisure and business travelers.</p>
            <h3>Route Highlights</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Operated mainly by Amtrak’s Pacific Surf liner</li>
                <li>Coastal views along much of the route</li>
                <li>Frequent service throughout the day</li>
                <li>Comfortable seating and onboard amenities</li>
            </ul>

