            <h3>What This Means for Travelers</h3>
            <p>The Los Angeles to San Diego train route offers a comfortable, stress-free travel option along southern California’s coast. The journey is suitable for both short visits and longer stays, thanks to its combination of speed, frequent departures, and scenic value.</p>
