            <h2>Step-by-Step Journey Experience</h2>
            <p>Understanding each stage of the journey from Los Angeles to San Diego can make your trip smoother, especially if you’re traveling for the first time. From arrival at the station to disembarking in San Diego, the process is simple and efficient.</p>
