            <ul>
                <li>The second-largest city in California, located along the Pacific Coast.</li>
                <li>Famous for its beaches, Balboa Park, and historic Old Town.</li>
                <li>Offers a mix of cultural attractions, shopping, and dining experiences.</li>
                <li>Family-friendly and accessible for tourists with diverse interests.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Top Attractions in San Diego</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Balboa Park:</b> Cultural hub with museums, gardens, and theaters.</li>
                <li><b>Gaslamp Quarter: </b>Historic district with restaurants, shops, and nightlife.</li>
                <li><b>San Diego Zoo:</b> World-renowned zoo in Balboa Park, perfect for families.</li>
                <li><b>Old Town San Diego: </b>Historic area showcasing early Californian architecture and culture.</li>
                <li><b>La Jolla Cove: </b>Scenic coastal spot for walking, wildlife, and ocean views.</li>
